IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROBE-ROUNDED.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  WS-IN       PIC S9(3)V9 VALUE 2.5.
01  WS-NEG      PIC S9(3)V9 VALUE -2.5.
01  WS-OUT      PIC S9(3).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    COMPUTE WS-OUT ROUNDED = WS-IN
    DISPLAY "rounded-pos " WS-OUT
    COMPUTE WS-OUT ROUNDED = WS-NEG
    DISPLAY "rounded-neg " WS-OUT
    COMPUTE WS-OUT = WS-IN
    DISPLAY "trunc-pos " WS-OUT
    COMPUTE WS-OUT = WS-NEG
    DISPLAY "trunc-neg " WS-OUT
    STOP RUN.
